1 NAME James /Henrie/
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 18 SEP 1827
2 PLAC Miami or Colerain, Hamilton Co., Ohio
3 MAP
4 LATI N39.256
4 LONG W84.588
2 NOTE As written: 18 Sept. 1827
1 DEAT
2 DATE 12 FEB 1916
2 PLAC Panguitch, Utah
3 MAP
4 LATI N37.823
