2 CONT 1944 & S.to H.]; m. Lloyd LaRoy Lund, s. of LeRoy & Marie
2 CONT (Thompson) Lund. He was b. 25 July 1925, in Ephraim, Utah [bapt. 1
2 CONT July 1934, end. 18 Nov. 1944]. They had 4 children, all b. in Salt Lake
2 CONT City, Utah:
2 CONT a. Philip Lloyd Lund, b. 13 Apr. 1946.
2 CONT b. Jean E. Lund, b. 10 Mar. 1948.
2 CONT c. Leali Dian Lund, b. 31 Aug. 1950. d. Ronald Lund, b. 7 Mar. 1952.
2 CONT Hansen & Sarah Marie (Giles) Hougaard. She was b. 9 Aug. 1912, in Manti. Grant graduated from Snow College at Ephraim, Utah; he later studied electrical engineering in Los Angeles and works as an elec
2 CONC trician; he also runs a farm and raises turkeys. They had 3 children, all b. in Manti:
2 CONT 1918, end. 18 Jan. 1946]. 1 child:
2 CONT 1946].
