1 NAME Samuel Osburn /Henrie/
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 23 JUL 1860
2 PLAC South Bountiful, Davis Co., Utah
3 MAP
4 LATI N40.86
4 LONG W111.884
2 NOTE As written: 23 July 1860
