2 CONT 1952].
2 CONT b. Diana Mae Heywood, b. 23 Mar. 1945.
2 CONT c. Janice Heywood, b. 19 Feb. 1951, Panguitch.
2 CONT She was b 25 Mar. 1935, in Panguitch.
2 CONT 1895; m. Joseph Owens.
2 CONT . They had 2 children, b. in Panguitch:
