2 CONT Bessie (Argile) Jordon. He was b. 10 Aug. 1929, Chopin, Idaho.
2 CONT Thomas Grant and Iris had 1 child, b. in Cedar City, Utah:
2 CONT 184]
2 CONT 1950, Salt Lake City, Utah.
2 CONT England. They had 2 children;
