2 NOTE As written: 10 Sept. 1917
1 NOTE She graduated from Brigham Young University and taught school 2 years before her marriage to Clarence, whom she met while attending Brigham Young University. At different times she has been a teacher
2 CONC in Sunday School and Primary, counselor in Primary, Young Ladies M.I.A. and Relief Society, and president of Young Ladies M I.A.
2 CONT Clarence received his B.A. degree at Brigham Young University in 1940, and his Master’s degree from the same school in 1951. He was in the Marine Corps for 3 yrs. during World War II. He has been a sc
2 CONC hool teacher at Roosevelt, Murray, and principal of Panguitch High School; at present he is principal of Lehi School at Mesa, Ariz. He has been a teacher in Sunday School and M.I.A., one of the 7 pres
2 CONC idents of the 400th Quorum of Seventies, and at present is in the bishopric in Mesa, Ariz.
1 NOTE LDS ordinances as recorded in the book: bapt. 5 June 1926, end. & S.to H. 3 June 1941; bapt. 1 Nov. 1924, end. 3 June 1941
