1 NOTE Hilma was only 5 years of age when the family moved to Eugene, Ore. She began her school there, also her study of piano under a Mrs. Richmons, and from the beginning she showed promise of unusual abil
2 CONC ity. She learned to read notes almost before she mastered her first grade lesson.
